  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // Issue #159 Stage A: tools/auto_spacing_survey.ts (SP01-SP06).
  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

  // SP01 — "fewest passing" on hand rows: only cells the stage accepted count (a refused or stopped row carrying a
